  title "Governance by Paralysis"
  summary "Following the death of elder mystic Veil☽ Glow, the penguin council fractures into competing factions unable to authorize crystal recharging before the approaching Long Dark. When Ice-Crowned Shexuwohua seizes the Radiant Aurora-harp during a heated session, the instrument fractures, triggering four penguins to Walk into the darkness and prompting the Pinnacle faction to seize control of both the harp and recharging authority. Though a compromise leader eventually restores crystal shipments at reduced capacity and the Accord survives, the underlying crisis remains unresolved: the Pinnacle now controls the harp, Noctisum~ the merchant pursues hidden negotiations, and Xi the smuggler shifts allegiances, each faction having maneuvered for advantage while the council's paralysis deepens."
